TREE-WALKING EXERCISE — CHAKRA CONTROL DRILL
Konohagakure Academy / Genin Training

Purpose: To teach precise, continuous chakra emission from the feet — a
foundational control skill introduced by Jonin sensei to new genin squads.

Method:
1. Focus a fixed amount of chakra to the soles of the feet.
2. Approach a tall tree and walk up the trunk without using the hands.
3. Too little chakra and you slip off; too much and the bark shatters and
   repels you. The goal is a steady, exact output.
4. Mark your highest point with a kunai each attempt and try to surpass it.

Notes: This drill builds the control needed for water-walking and for
efficient use of chakra in combat. Team 7 famously used this exercise
during the Land of Waves mission. Recommended repetition until the
trainee can ascend and descend at a run. Progress to the water-walking
exercise once mastered.
